        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1191_3917.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser fründtlich willig diennst. Sambt was wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eeren</unclear>
<lb n="2"/>liebs unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetz</unclear> vermoegendt zuvor. From, fürsichtig,
<lb n="3"/>ersam, wyß, insonnders <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guet</unclear> fründt unnd gethrüwen
<lb n="4"/>lieben <orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnossen</unclear></orgName>. Der vest, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethrüw</unclear>-
<lb n="5"/>er lieber Burger <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hainrich</unclear> Peyer</persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hatt</unclear> unns
<lb n="6"/>gehorsamblich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anbracht</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuerkennen</unclear> geben,
<lb n="7"/>Nachdem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wylandt</unclear> üwers Burgers <persName resp="#ner">Laurentzen
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zollickhofers</unclear></persName> seligen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verlaßne</unclear> wittib, sin <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründt</unclear>-
<lb n="9"/>liche liebe fraw <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muetter</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schwiger</unclear>, uß hertz-
<lb n="10"/>lichen gethrüwen bewegenden ursachen, iren ge-
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">liebten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soenen</unclear>, nitt allain namhaffte <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">haab</unclear> unnd
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">güetter</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">züubergeben</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuezustellen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sonnders</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> denselben iren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soenen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ire</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hievoor</unclear> hinuß ge-
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hürathgüetter</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">merers</unclear> (als verehrung,
<lb n="15"/>gaab, unnd ouch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hürathguetz</unclear>) <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">züubelegen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zustaigern</unclear>,
<lb n="16"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zümehren</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßglychen</unclear> inen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">merern</unclear>
<lb n="17"/>unnd bestimpten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorthail</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">züverdingten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hette</unclear>
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sy</unclear> sich, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mitt</unclear> guetter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">züthiger</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorbetrachtung</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geheptem</unclear>
<lb n="19"/>rath, ouch uß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frygem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethrüwem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muetterlichem</unclear> willen,
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dochin</unclear> endtschlossen, die anndern ire geliebte <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kinder</unclear>,
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">doechtern</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">doechtermaenner</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sovil</unclear> die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hürathgütter</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">belangte</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">glychmaessig</unclear>, als die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">soene</unclear>, unnd also ain
<lb n="23"/>kind wie das annder, (<unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sy</unclear> syen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glych</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhürath</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oder</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nitt</unclear>) zehalten unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zübetrachten</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">domit</unclear>
<lb n="25"/>unnder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inen</unclear> (iren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kindern</unclear>) ain <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">glychait</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründt</unclear>-
<lb n="26"/>lich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">liebliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ainigkhait</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gepflanntzt</unclear> unnd erhalten
<lb n="27"/>werde, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Inmassen</unclear> dann schon <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alberaith</unclear>
<lb n="28"/>beschehen, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sy</unclear> die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhüratheten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">doechtern</unclear>,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1191_3918.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tochtermänner</unclear>, nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allein</unclear> die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelieferten</unclear>,
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonder</unclear> ouch an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jetzo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">letst</unclear> bestimpte <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ueberlegung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hürath</unclear>-
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guots</unclear>, zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dannckh</unclear> empfanngen haben. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dwil</unclear> nun
<lb n="32"/>sin <persName resp="#ner">Hainrich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Preÿers</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hußfrawen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beruerter</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">züge</unclear>
<lb n="33"/>an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear>, an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inne</unclear> begertt worden, von unns,
<lb n="34"/>gloubhafften schÿn ußzebringen, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürzelegen</unclear>,
<lb n="35"/>wie wir es <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bÿ</unclear> unns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sölicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fhälen</unclear> hielten, ob ainer,
<lb n="36"/>von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sölicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ueberlegung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wÿtern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hürathguots</unclear>, was ab=
<lb n="37"/>zug <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gelts</unclear> geben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sölte</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mueßte</unclear>, oder nitt: etc.
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnderthenigs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">flÿßes</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pittende</unclear>, ime deß ain schrifft=
<lb n="39"/>liche <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getzüegkhnuß</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">urkhundt</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schÿne</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mitt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ze=</unclear>
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thailen</unclear>. Wann nun wir ime unnserm
<lb n="41"/>burger <persName resp="#ner">Hainrich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Preÿen</unclear></persName>, diß sin <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pittliche</unclear> begeren nitt
<lb n="42"/>abschlagen wöllen, so sagen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gereden</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bekhennen</unclear>
<lb n="43"/>wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiemit</unclear>, das sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sölliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fhäle</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> sachen,
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vilmaln</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bÿ</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnsern</unclear> geliebten vorfarn, unnd unnsern
<lb n="45"/>regierenden zÿthen, zuogetragen, unnd begeben,
<lb n="46"/>daran aber, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">niemaln</unclear>, kain abzug gelt gefordert, noch
<lb n="47"/>genomen, sonnders <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sÿe</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnsere</unclear> vorfarn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> wir,
<lb n="48"/>wann man <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">also</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ueber</unclear> das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erst</unclear> empfanngen, noch
<lb n="49"/>merers <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hürathguot</unclear> hinuß geben, wir dasselbig
<lb n="50"/>alles, one ainichen abzug, frÿÿ willig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vahren</unclear> unnd
<lb n="51"/>erfolgen lassen, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sÿen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">enndtschlossen</unclear>,
<lb n="52"/>dasselbig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinfürter</unclear>, gegen allen jhenigen zehalten
<lb n="53"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zethuondt</unclear>, die ain <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">söllichs</unclear> eben: und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glÿchmässig</unclear>,
<lb n="54"/>gegen unns, unnd den unnsern, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zethuondt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesÿnnet</unclear> und
<lb n="55"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewillet</unclear> sin, sich also verhalten unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erzaigen</unclear> werden,
<lb n="56"/>demnach, so gelangt unnser nachparlich flÿßig und
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1191_3919.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="57"/>fründtlichs <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pitten</unclear> an üch, Ir wöllen merbemeltem
<lb n="58"/>unnserm burger <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hainrich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wyßen</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">desselbem</unclear>
<lb n="59"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hußfrawen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ligend</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ererbtguot</unclear>, ouch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">one</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ainich</unclear>
<lb n="60"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abtzug</unclear> gelt, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freÿg</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuostohn</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verfolgen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">si</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">also</unclear>
<lb n="61"/>diser unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getzückgnuß</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürschrifft</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pitts</unclear>,
<lb n="62"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruchtparlich</unclear> geniessen lassen. Das wöllen
<lb n="63"/>wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">In</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glichen</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mererem</unclear>, zu begebenden
<lb n="64"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fhälen</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelegenhaiten</unclear>, umb üch unnd die
<lb n="65"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwern</unclear>, nachparlich unnd fründtlich. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erwidern</unclear>.
<lb n="66"/>beschulden unnd verdienen. Datum <origDate when="1586" resp="#ner">Mentags.
<lb n="67"/>den. 11.t Julii, anno. 1586</origDate>.
<lb n="68"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-28" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermaister unnd rath
<lb n="69"/>der statt Schaffhusen</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1191_3920.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="70"/>Den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fromen</unclear>, fürsichtigen, ersamen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wijsen</unclear>,
<lb n="71"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermaister unnd Rath der statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sannct</unclear>
<lb n="72"/>Gallen</orgName>, unsern <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">insonders</unclear> guten
<lb n="73"/>fründen unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwen</unclear> lieben Eidt-
<lb n="74"/>gnossen.
</p>
